の男性声優。ケンユウオフィス所属。東京都出身。血液型はO型。旧名は鹿糠 光明（読み同じ）。以前はアドヴァンスプロモーション、劇団朋友に所属していた。講道館柔道二段の資格を持つ。","career":["seiyu"],"id":15666,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":159810},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/da/54/159811_crt_k3Ww2.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/da/54/159811_crt_k3Ww2.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/da/54/159811_crt_k3Ww2.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/da/54/159811_crt_k3Ww2.jpg"},"name":"田野","summary":"","relation":"闲角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/dd/ea/15666_prsn_n3T23.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/dd/ea/15666_prsn_n3T23.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/dd/ea/15666_prsn_n3T23.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/dd/ea/15666_prsn_n3T23.jpg"},"name":"かぬか光明","short_summary":"日本の男性声優。ケンユウオフィス所属。東京都出身。血液型はO型。旧名は鹿糠 光明（読み同じ）。以前はアドヴァンスプロモーション、劇団朋友に所属していた。講道館柔道二段の資格を持つ。","career":["seiyu"],"id":15666,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":159811},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/b6/7a/167053_crt_ERHAe.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/b6/7a/167053_crt_ERHAe.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/b6/7a/167053_crt_ERHAe.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/b6/7a/167053_crt_ERHAe.jpg"},"name":"TOGENASHI TOGEARI","summary":"TOGENASHI TOGEARI是《GIRLS BAND CRY》及其衍生作品的登场乐队，以及企划下的真实女子乐队。\r\n\r\n在TV动画中，该乐队的前身为新川崎（仮）和beni-shouga（红生姜）。 \r\n\r\n[size=25]简介[/size]\r\n图标中的乐队名可以拆分为TOGE-NASHI TOGE-ARI，简称TOGETOGE。意思为无刺有刺，乐队名是在企划会议上十分随意地决定的，灵感可能来自于一种昆虫[s]如果使用二进制的方法表达有无，乐队名可以简称为toge0toge1。[/s]\r\n\r\n在TV动画中，乐队名是仁菜根据现场观众穿着的衣服即兴命名的。现场观众穿着的衣服上写着「トゲアリトゲナシトゲトゲ」，是一种名称奇特的昆虫。（（日文）トゲハムシ亚科）该昆虫是尖刺叶甲虫中无刺的变种。由于在日语中同时出现了4个トゲ，成为了一种受大众关注的昆虫，以至于朝日电视台也有一节目系列以这种昆虫命名。\r\n\r\n图标中的乐队名片假名「トゲナシトゲアリ」刻意营造成带刺的感觉。","relation":"主角","actors":[],"type":4,"id":167053},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/07/81/167054_crt_0mAQ0.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/07/81/167054_crt_0mAQ0.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/07/81/167054_crt_0mAQ0.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/07/81/167054_crt_0mAQ0.jpg"},"name":"Diamond Dust","summary":"Diamond Dust是《GIRLS BAND CRY》及其衍生作品的登场乐队。为了与旧Diamond Dust作出区别，观众习惯以ndd（New Diamond Dust）称呼新Diamond Dust。 \r\n\r\n[size=25]简介[/size]\r\nDiamond Dust的图标为雪花的形状。图标中的文字仅由直线组成，也许与钻石星尘为晶体的特性有关。\r\n\r\n在剧情中，Diamond Dust是由桃香、凛、奈奈、爱四人在高中尚未毕业时辍学到东京创建的乐队。在约三年的活动期间推出了空の箱在内等歌曲及唱片，但始终未能获得足够人气。\r\n\r\n以传统本格乐队为目标的四人曾接受事务所的建议，改变自己的形象和曲风，包装成偶像系少女乐队出道。成员之一的桃香始终未能接受自己为了获得人气而放弃自己的音乐风格，离开了Diamond Dust。其后，事务所起用了新主唱雏，乐队再次展开活动。\r\n\r\n新Diamond Dust四人都采用了非常常见的名字，且并没有公布姓氏，可能为角色的艺名。为了突出个人形象，新Diamond Dust的四人均有染发。","relation":"配角","actors":[],"type":4,"id":167054},{"images":{"small":"","grid":"","large":"","medium":""},"name":"観客","summary":"","relation":"闲角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/8a/56/94153_prsn_x7sxu.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/8a/56/94153_prsn_x7sxu.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/8a/56/94153_prsn_x7sxu.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/8a/56/94153_prsn_x7sxu.jpg"},"name":"水嶋光","short_summary":"","career":["seiyu"],"id":94153,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/47/10/94182_prsn_ME7f6.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/47/10/94182_prsn_ME7f6.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/47/10/94182_prsn_ME7f6.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/47/10/94182_prsn_ME7f6.jpg"},"name":"土生駿","short_summary":"","career":["seiyu"],"id":94182,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/dc/6d/94183_prsn_O9ARO.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/dc/6d/94183_prsn_O9ARO.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/dc/6d/94183_prsn_O9ARO.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/dc/6d/94183_prsn_O9ARO.jpg"},"name":"井上歌奏子","short_summary":"","career":["seiyu"],"id":94183,"type":1,"locked":false},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/p