）称呼新Diamond Dust。 \r\n\r\n[size=25]简介[/size]\r\nDiamond Dust的图标为雪花的形状。图标中的文字仅由直线组成，也许与钻石星尘为晶体的特性有关。\r\n\r\n在剧情中，Diamond Dust是由桃香、凛、奈奈、爱四人在高中尚未毕业时辍学到东京创建的乐队。在约三年的活动期间推出了空の箱在内等歌曲及唱片，但始终未能获得足够人气。\r\n\r\n以传统本格乐队为目标的四人曾接受事务所的建议，改变自己的形象和曲风，包装成偶像系少女乐队出道。成员之一的桃香始终未能接受自己为了获得人气而放弃自己的音乐风格，离开了Diamond Dust。其后，事务所起用了新主唱雏，乐队再次展开活动。\r\n\r\n新Diamond Dust四人都采用了非常常见的名字，且并没有公布姓氏，可能为角色的艺名。为了突出个人形象，新Diamond Dust的四人均有染发。","name":"Diamond Dust","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"钻石星尘"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"纯假名","v":"ダイヤモンドダスト"}]},{"key":"引用来源","value":[{"k":"萌娘百科","v":"https://zh.moegirl.org.cn/Diamond_Dust"}]}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":3},"id":167054,"locked":false,"type":4,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"male","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/da/54/159811_crt_k3Ww2.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/da/54/159811_crt_k3Ww2.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/da/54/159811_crt_k3Ww2.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/da/54/159811_crt_k3Ww2.jpg"},"summary":"","name":"田野","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"田野"},{"key":"别名","value":[]},{"key":"性别","value":"男"}],"stat":{"comments":1,"collects":0},"id":159811,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/fd/41/156740_crt_vZgMz.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/fd/41/156740_crt_vZgMz.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/fd/41/156740_crt_vZgMz.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/fd/41/156740_crt_vZgMz.jpg"},"summary":"","name":"リン","infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"罗马字","v":"Rin"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"女"},{"key":"年龄","value":"20"}],"stat":{"comments":10,"collects":26},"id":156740,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/p